  "goodToKnow": "Der Anleger (die Anlegerin) is an investor: private Anleger, institutionelle Anleger. Geld anlegen means to invest money, and die Geldanlage an investment. Der Kleinanleger is a small private investor. Der Anleger is also a jetty or landing stage, since Schiffe legen an (ships dock). Germans have traditionally preferred the Sparbuch (savings account), but more are becoming Anleger in ETFs."
